flowchart TD
    A[Client / Frontend] --> B[API Gateway / Backend Server]

    B --> C{User Authenticated?}

    C -- No --> D[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    C -- Yes --> E[Validate Request Data]

    E --> F{Valid Input?}

    F -- No --> G[Return 400 Bad Request]
    F -- Yes --> H[Route to Correct API Module]

    H --> I{API Type}

    I -- Auth API --> J[Login / Register / JWT]
    I -- Project API --> K[Create / Select Project]
    I -- Target API --> L[Add Target URL or IP]
    I -- Scan API --> M[Start Scan Job]
    I -- AI API --> N[Generate Attack Suggestions]
    I -- Report API --> O[Generate PDF Report]

    J --> P[Return Auth Result]
    K --> Q[Return Project Result]
    L --> R[Return Target Result]
    M --> S[Return Scan Result]
    N --> T[Return AI Recommendation Result]
    O --> U[Return Report Download Link]